      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "Purpose: This study aimed to assess the efficacy and safety of berberine(BBR) plus 5-aminosalicylic acid (5-ASA) for treating ulcerative colitis (UC).",
      "reason": "An explicit objective is stated (to assess efficacy and safety of BBR plus 5-ASA for UC), but the statement does not use a recognized question-formulation framework (e.g., PICO) as required by the element."
