      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "A comprehensive search ... to identify all randomized controlled trials (RCTs) that administered BBR conjunction in standard therapy(5-ASA) for to support the treatment of UC. The primary endpoint was the clinical efficacy rate. In contrast, the secondary endpoints included the Baron score, disease activity index (DAI) score, symptom relief latency, inflammatory markers, immunological indicators, and adverse events.",
